<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Roche.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Roche.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 2.5 million American-style call warrants on Roche, lead manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    10000 CHF		 ISSUE PRICE  8.85 CHF</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	09.APR.98		 PAYDATE	04.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING APPLIED-ZURICH		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  9585 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
